  "title": "Quick and Easy Chicken",
  "description": "This quick and easy chicken recipe is made with seared chicken breasts simmered in a sweet and zingy mixture of soy sauce, ketchup, and lemon juice.",
  "authors": [
    "Anny"
  ],
